cmu-mohawk-free-fire-help = Enables continuous AI scanning until disabled. Approve each new target to permit fire. Ground AI requires landing on the planet, a seated gunner with this console open, and renewed authorization every thirty seconds. It cannot fire in a shipside hangar. During active CAS flybys, AI scans all registered flares and chooses compatible feeds. AI cannot engage through walls, even with Thermal. Manual control pauses AI. A target change clears approval. Disabling AI starts a five-minute cooldown.
